{"strongs": "H1364", "word": "גָּבֹהַּ", "translit": "ga.vo.ah", "root": "גבה", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "high, exalted", "definition": "גָּבֹהַּ adjective high, exalted — 1Sam 9:2 + 15 t.; גָּבוֺהַּ Ps 138:6 construct גְּבֹהַּ 1Sam 16:7 גְּבַהּ ( Ew § 213 d ) Ps 101:5 + 3 t.; plural גְּבֹהִים Eccl 5:7 + 5 t.; feminine גְּבֹהָה Deut 3:5 + 6 t.; plural גְּבֹהוֺת Dan 8:3 + 2 t.; גְּבֹהֹת Deut 28:52 — 1. high, lofty, tall , e.g. tree Ezek 17:24 , tower Isa 2:15 ; Zeph 1:16 , mountain Gen 7:19 ; Ps 104:18 ; Isa 40:9 ; Isa 57:7 ; Ezek 17:22 ; Ezek 40:2 compare phrases על כל גבעה גבהה upon every high hill 1Kgs 14:23 ; 2Kgs 17:10 ; Jer 2:20 על גבעות הגבהות Jer 17:2 עַלכָּֿלהַֿר גָּבֹהַּ Isa 30:25 ; Jer 3:6 man 1Sam 9:2 tree גְּבַהּ קוֺמָה Ezek 31:3 horns Dan 8:3 walls Deut 3:5 ; Deut 28:52 gallows Esth 5:14 ; Esth 7:9 gate Jer 51:58 altar Ezek 41:22 high things Job 41:26 ; Eccl 12:5 . 2. exalted in station Ezek 21:31 כִּי גָּבֹהַּ מֵעַל גָּבֹהַּ שֹׁמֵר וּגְבֹהִים עֲלֵיהֶם for high one above high one is watching, & the Most High over them Eccl 5:7 so Ew Zö and others, but Vrss De Now and others higher (earthly), potentates over them . 3. haughty Ps 138:6 ; Isa 5:15 ; Isa 10:33 ; 1Sam 2:3 גְּבַהּעֵֿינַיִם Ps 101:5 לֵב ׳ ג Prov 16:5 רוּחַ ׳ ג Eccl 7:8 . 4. noun [masculine] loftiness , גִּבֹהַּ קוֺמַתוֺ 1Sam 16:7 compare גָּדוֺל 10 , p. 153.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1427')\">BDB1427</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1364')\">H1364</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H1362')\">H1362</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1426')\">BDB1426</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1428')\">BDB1428</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גָּבֹהַּ</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>high, exalted</highlightword> — <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,2)\">1Sam 9:2</ref> + 15 t.; <bdbheb>גָּבוֺהַּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 138:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"138\" vBegin